+---
+'@tanstack/query-core': patch
+'@tanstack/query-persist-client-core': patch
+---
+
+Add `createPersisterRestoreResult` to query-core so fine-grained persisted queries can restore the full cached query state (errors, failure counters, timestamps, invalidation markers and infinite-query pagination) instead of being rewritten as a fresh successful fetch. Bulk restoration now preserves the same semantics and merges data and error freshness independently when a persisted snapshot is restored over an existing live query.
